Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mune wo koga shite ni Wazure raeta a shita
