Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.28,0:01:43.24,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(327,434)}(25th 8AM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Dramon
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.67,0:02:01.18,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,650)\pos(323,356)}2002/12/25 11:40 AM
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.47,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(319,329)}Great Melee in New York and Hong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a strange report\Ncoming in off the newswire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says there are monsters\Nall over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the ones on public television?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My kids can't get enough\Nof those cute fuzzy things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, real monsters and big black towers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a UFO.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better report this to NASA right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our stop, Imperial Dremont.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK and I will stay here in Paris\Nto organize the French Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vive la France!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can get great deals here in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder the Chinese\Nwanted it back so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do they call this place\NDown Under? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't speak Australian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is warm and cozy while\Nwe're in the middle of a Moscow blizzard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shot, Imperial German.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get to our destination.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.68,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\pos(330,239)}2002/12/24 10:15 PM, Miami Beach
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.68,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\pos(328,434)}(25th 12:15 PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally got a lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only trouble is, they\Nforgot to put a light in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miami, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back to plain old FEMA now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just low on energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be good as new once\Nwe get some food in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, we're supposed to hook up\Nwith Michael somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope you guys like to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and Matt, you guys take\Nthe helicopter to Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, you and I are taking\Nthe Red Eye to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm watching a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy was in my\Nfavorite movie of all time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.54,movie poster 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\pos(340,289)\frz6.637}SHOOT THE DARKNESS
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.54,movie poster 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\org(334,427)\frz5.957\pos(337,426)\c&HF6F6F6&}Hell's Target
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I see you guys have met my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Michael, you never told me your\Ndad was a Hollywood movie star.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for some action.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.47,0:04:54.52,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,800)\pos(317,234)}2002/12/24 11PM, Niagara Falls, America
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.47,0:04:54.52,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,800)\pos(325,439)}(25th 1PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him, scared out of his\Nmind, waiting for us to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there are two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think it is, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the fat one is asking\Nthe flying one for some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's going on there i know it\Nsounds crazy but i think there's a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little kid on that monster's shoulder\Nthey're retreating troops let's move
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out general we just received this\Nimportant dispatch from headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems the monsters all over the\Ncountry are headed for new york city
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell them we're on our way there if those\Nmonsters think the army is tough wait
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,till they get a load of new york it's\Nentirely possible that the land where new york
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.03,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx90\fscy90\pos(309,238)}2002/12/25 2AM, Manhattan, New York
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.03,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx90\fscy90\pos(308,406)}(25th 4PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now stands used to be the monsters prehistoric\Nbreeding ground and they are simply
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.07,0:05:52.58,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\pos(324,357)}New York Suburbs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,following their instincts by returning in\Nother words they're like salmon swimming
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:06:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,upstream only these salmon have giant\Nfangs and claws no not again it's not fair
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we had such horrible things happen to\Nus four years ago in odiva now the same
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing's happening to us again here in\Namerica don't tell me we're moving again i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't want to change jobs again and and\NI'm sure Mimi doesn't wanna change schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Mom and Dad, running away from\Nmonsters with you is tons of fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I forgot to do\Nsomething very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't the others here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the runway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all headed for Central Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're sending all the\NDigimon our way because
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they know we're the only\Nones who can handle the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad always gets the\Nmunchies whenever he flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Mimi, did you come up\Nwith this plan to meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dear friend came up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gennai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to confuse you, my\Nfriend, but my name is Benjamin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Benjamin's Gennai's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he looks exactly like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because Gennai and I\Nwere once one and the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you get any more confusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything\Nonce this is all over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time I turn around, there's\Nmore Gennai's and more Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you hang out with any\Nother Digidestined kids, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the kids that got their\NDigivices at the same time I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but everyone else I\Njust know through Mimic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to meet the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you won't have long to wait\Nbecause they're gonna be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many of\Nthem have heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost at Central Park, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Cherrymon, that's not an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a Christmas tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cherrymon, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better call someone for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A boy named Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said there's a Cherrymon attacking\Nthe Christmas tree at Rockefeller Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is nothing sacred?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, V-Mon. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, wait up! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Rockefeller Center is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I haven't got a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's typical Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about if we all go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't I come along, too, just in case\Nyou guys need the power Gennai gave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from a Zoolongmon's digicore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean what I think it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I can digivolve? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:10:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tobermon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lillymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thadamon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, troops, move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm telling you, the jelly field\Nis much better than the bear claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Custard beats them both, hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not slowing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's help when you need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flowery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't work because he's not\Nunder the control of a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just doesn't like other trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, Axe-V-Mon, it's time to put that\Ngiant cherry tree on ice. On ice? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, don't worry, leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you meant by\Nputting him on ice, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pet filter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-V-mon! Flymon! Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flurizamon! Somalad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Maria, did\Nsomebody call for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throne Campus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Lou, is everybody alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sub-Zero-Ice-Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pleasure is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we please take care of\Nall the introductions later?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of something here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blaze Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.10,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed Blazer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's teamwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Dustin style, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:13:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Davis, but I'm sure\Nyou already know all about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I've never heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Digimon present and accounted for!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen that fairy-looking\Nthing back in Odaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It almost took Mimi from us once before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let her out of your sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With any luck, she'll lead us to Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're all here now. Let's get\Ndown to business. The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you now Davis just remember we're all\Nbehind you wait till I turn around
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digiport open so that's\Nwhat a digiport looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Digimon are being\Nsucked in. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, thanks for coming\Nall this way to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have been able\Nto do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not letting all\Nthis praise go to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.32,0:14:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right! Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are! Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all right, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you warm enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have enough to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.98,0:14:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid, tell me\Nwhat's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, there's a simple explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, anybody got one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, son, I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Davis, think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not dumb like everyone says.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What monsters? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see any monsters around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When in doubt, deny, deny, deny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who says I'm so dumb?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.50,0:15:05.09,jogress shadow,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\fad(450,0)\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(320,236)\fscx90\fscy90}2002/12/25 12PM, Nathan Road, Hong Kong
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.50,0:15:05.09,jogress shadow,,0,0,0,,{\be1\pos(329,437)}{\fad(450,0)\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(326,434)}(25th 1PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This charm should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil spirit, be God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to get snotty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this to us! To you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you boys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.40,0:15:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Auto-mon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt him anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.38,0:15:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.98,0:15:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you guys have Digimon, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, explain to them\Nabout being Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're a part of\Na fraternal society.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, how many times do I have to tell\Nyou when explaining things keep it simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, let me start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're digivice-carrying titans\Ndestined to save the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I could explain better if\NI had visual aids to work with,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I left my charts and graphs at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to function\Nunder these primitive conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Digimon you attacked wasn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a long way from home, scared\Nand confused, just like you would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We would be honored if you would\Njoin our team of kids around
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world who are safely returning\Nthese Digimon to their homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Izzy Izumi, and I\Ncame all the way from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is my Digidestined friend, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our friend, Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sent here to help us out\Nin case we got into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you three guys are the\NDigidestined children of Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:16:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:16:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the Poi Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is quite a shock,\Nbut believe me, it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're herding the lost\NDigimon into Kulong Park
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we can return them\Nsafely to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you please join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.28,0:17:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huddle up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we join them so afterwards I can\Nask the Japanese girl out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you not tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we've decided\Nto work together with Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined and their Digimon are\Nstarting to arrive from all over Asia.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.20,jogress shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\be1\pos(313,237)\fscx90\fscy90}2002/12/25 2:30PM, Kowloon Park, Hong Kong
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.20,jogress shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\be1\pos(328,435)}(25th 3:30PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think Jackie heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one, and two, and three,\Nand four, and five, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we'll get this\Nover with before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get to take Kari out for the\Nbest Hong Kong meal she's ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an email from a girl\Nnamed Mina who lives in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything\Nlater, but right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've got to get to\Nthe China-India border.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can one of you please come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Meramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that they think\Nthat we're the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we try to cross the border\Ninto China, we might start a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, General? I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never stopped monsters\Nfrom crossing our border before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.98,0:18:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, by air.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about a thing, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon and I will\Nhold off the Chinese army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, and while we keep them\Nbusy, get the others to Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This situation calls for diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing we want to do is cause an
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,international incident\Nthat results in a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we have to explain it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go through that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:18:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Kari, you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.06,0:19:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me? Oh, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably better if a Digimon\Nexplains it to them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the problem is, if\Nwe approach, they attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got a great\Nidea. They're attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like one of them has a blow dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's a fight they\Nwant, then they've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spartan Age!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your spelling, Octamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's going to be a quiz later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We come in peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant, I think we've landed\Nin the middle of a B-movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't going to\Nlook good on my resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep this maneuver\Nour little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We parked! Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's explain our situation\Nto them and get to Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:20:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's a good idea\Nto let them cross, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all part of the same army\Nwhen it comes to saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone, for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we're finished, why\Ndon't I show you around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the Poi Brothers\Nhave a crush on you, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you the one that\Ngets to shake Kari's hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too young!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.68,0:20:48.18,Date Shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\fscx50\fscy50\pos(318,386)}Tokyo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're all alone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to connect with my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drive together with my hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drive together with my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I connect with my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I connect.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.25,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.26,0:22:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with my hand?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always going to go,\Nand I'm going to fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.78,0:22:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always going to go, and\NI'm always going to be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.18,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always going to be one person.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.18,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.27,0:23:00.14,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\pos(324,326)}Great Battle at Coral and Versailles!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.20,0:23:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

